First version of MonAmie:
• See your team on the map and share your location.
• Browse past routes day by day on a calendar.
• Call anyone on your team list through Meet.
• Create your organization, with one or more administrators, build teams and invite people by e-mail.
• Customize your organization's name, theme and logo.
• Choose how often your location is sent (Economy).
• Delete your account in the app, with 30 days to change your mind.
